1) Setup project directory
mkdir myapp
cd myapp

2) Write web application code
vi main.py

from flask import Flask
app=Flask(__name__)
@app.route('/')
def hello():
    return 'hello world'
if __name__=='__main__':
    app.run

3) Create requirements.txt file
vi requirements.txt

Flask==2.1.0

4) Create app.yaml file
vi app.yaml

runtime: python39
automatic_scaling:
  min_instances: 0
  max_instances: 5
  target_cpu_utilization: 0.65

5) Deploy the application
gcloud auth login
gcloud init
gcloud app deploy

6) Access your application
gcloud app browse

python3 main.py(without billing account)
